                    Confidential. Drafted by Allen and approved by John M. Cates. Sent to Bogot#,
                    Buenos Aires, Caracas, Kingston, La Paz, Montevideo, Port-au-Prince, Port of
                    Spain, Rio de Janeiro, Santiago, and Santo Domingo.</p>
